      "label": "",
      "caption": "",
      "displayWidth": 100
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "提示:产物为六元环衍生物,并连接两个芳环取代基。"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "解答:"
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "src": "data/stems/assets/problem-000268-figure-016.jpg",
      "assetId": "asset-003323",
      "alt": "NHC硼自由基催化：第16幅原卷结构或数据示意",
      "label": "",
      "caption": "",
      "displayWidth": 100
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2 分;骨架错误不得分。"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1 分"
    },
